The script displays version numbers for system components.  It is
useful  for  finding out the installed versions of the components
of a system.  The utility uses a combination of ways to  retrieve
version  information from the installed utilities.  The following
options are available: This option provides a destination  direc‐
tory,  used  as  the root directory of an alternative set of pro‐
grams and libraries.  This can be useful for finding versions  of
utilities and libraries rooted in the file system directory, such
as the destination directory from a run.  Give a list of directo‐
ries  that  are  used when searching for libraries.  If not given
the value of is used if set in the environment,  or  otherwise  a
standard  (built‐in)  set  of directories.  Set If not given, the
